    <briefdescription>
<para>Files in GSYM are contained in <ref refid="structllvm_1_1gsym_1_1_file_entry" kindref="compound">FileEntry</ref> structs where we split the directory and basename into two different strings in the string table. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This allows paths to shared commont directory and filename strings and saves space. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
